# INVWINWD.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: Split units at
# level 1, a reader.  Duplicate (CTRL-D) on the item list is refused
# with INV's box, which ENTER closes; the Record menu's Split units
# entry is grayed, and chosen does nothing.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINWD.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K DOWN CTRL-D
S REFUSED
K ENTER
S CLOSED
K ALT-C
S MENU
K U
S MENUU
K ALT-F X
